          }
        ],
        "text": "(Poomalai is making preparations to leave town. A girl who studies under her comes to her.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s019-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பெண்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s019-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 27,
            "printedPage": 19
          }
        ],
        "text": "Why are you going to the city, amma?...",
        "notes": [
          "`அம்மா` is retained as the respectful/familiar address `amma` rather than assigning a relationship not stated by the source."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s019-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s019-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 27,
            "printedPage": 19
          }
        ],
        "text": "Kumudha's examination result will be known in two days. I am going to bring her back.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s019-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண்டுமணி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s019-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 27,
            "printedPage": 19
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Coming in) Amma! Amma! Do you know what happened! The girl chosen for our young master......",
        "notes": [
          "The corrected source label is exactly `குண்டுமணி`; the stale `குணமணி` metadata is removed."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s019-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s019-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 27,
            "printedPage": 19
          }
        ],
        "text": "The wedding is today. What about it?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s019-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண்டுமணி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s019-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 27,
            "printedPage": 19
          }
        ],
        "text": "They say the girl ran away last night!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s019-u007",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s019-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 27,
            "printedPage": 19
          }
        ],
        "text": "Is that so! (Thinking) Hmm...where is Paranthaman?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s019-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண்டுமணி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s019-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 28,
            "printedPage": 20
          }
        ],
        "text": "He...he...hmm...he was telling Garudan that he too had to go to Madras.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s019-u009",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s019-d008",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 28,
            "printedPage": 20
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Thoughtfully) Hmm...all right, get going. It's time for the train.",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
